{
  "id": "section-773",
  "title": "对北京师范学院调查材料的批示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-153.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>153)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　学生负担过重，影响健康，学了也无用。建议从一切活动总量中砍掉三分之一。邀请学校师生代表，讨论几次，决定执行。如何请酌。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-152.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-154.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
